      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1yslv1v'
    '|a||Call the mould''s cost c, its value to the buyer V, and its resale value R.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6160
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Squeezed down to its resale value, the maker builds only if R is at least c.':
