      ms: 5520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:os7294'
    '|a||But for the two of them together, building pays whenever V is at least c.':
