      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:5pxq0g'
    '|a||So every project with R below c, and c below V, is a good investment that hold-up kills.':
